    <string name="main_export_encrypted_body">Enter your app password. The backup file is encrypted with this same password. It counts toward the 10-attempt limit. Anyone who gets the file can guess at that password on a computer, with no attempt limit, so keep backups somewhere private. Changing your password later does not protect backups already saved.</string>
    <string name="main_csv_warning">The CSV exposes every password in plain text. Seed phrases and 2FA keys are never included. Don\'t open it in a spreadsheet, and delete it after migration.</string>
